        ["The lines (perfumes, quantities, prices) are not corrected here: they moved the stock. To change them, cancel the invoice in Invoices and record the right one.", "Las líneas (perfumes, cantidades, precios) no se corrigen aquí: movieron el stock. Para cambiarlas, anula la factura en Facturas y registra la correcta."],
